as a criminal offense,
at the request of the mayor.

00:08:54.601 --> 00:08:56.000
-Thank you.
I yield.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:57.300
-[ As Boebert ]
Thank you. I yield.
[ Laughter ]

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.868
And now, if you'll excuse me,

00:08:58.868 --> 00:09:00.300
I'm going back to my office
to figure out

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:02.000
what the [bleep]
I actually do here.

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.534
[ Laughter ]

00:09:03.534 --> 00:09:05.300
Although, later in the hearing,
when a Democratic member

00:09:05.300 --> 00:09:06.701
of the committee
took a swipe at Boebert,

00:09:06.701 --> 00:09:09.801
Boebert actually piped up,
as if she wanted another shot

00:09:09.801 --> 00:09:11.634
at the whole public
urination discussion.

00:09:11.634 --> 00:09:13.167
-They're choosing
to waste our time

00:09:13.167 --> 00:09:16.701
by meddling
in the District of Columbia

00:09:16.701 --> 00:09:20.167
and talking about public
urination, over and over.

00:09:20.167 --> 00:09:22.033
I just want to make sure --
do you have anything additional

00:09:22.033 --> 00:09:23.834
you want to say
about public urination?

00:09:23.834 --> 00:09:25.000
[ Laughter ]
Now's your time.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.667
-I do.

00:09:26.667 --> 00:09:27.567
-No, not you.

00:09:27.567 --> 00:09:28.868
[ Laughter ]
I'm talking to --

00:09:28.868 --> 00:09:30.100
It's not your time.

00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:33.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:35.701
-She basically said, "Shoo,
get out of here, shoo."

00:09:35.701 --> 00:09:37.534
[ Laughter ]

00:09:37.534 --> 00:09:39.000
Not only does Boebert want
to keep talking

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.567
about public urination,
she doesn't even know

00:09:40.567 --> 00:09:41.901
how congressional hearings work.

00:09:41.901 --> 00:09:44.267
She was talking to the witness,
not you, but I guess

00:09:44.267 --> 00:09:46.701
asking if you have anything
to add on public urination

00:09:46.701 --> 00:09:48.968
in front of Boebert
is like saying to my kids,

00:09:48.968 --> 00:09:51.434
"Anyone have 45 minutes
of punctuation-less thoughts

00:09:51.434 --> 00:09:52.634
about dinosaurs?"

00:09:52.634 --> 00:09:55.067
"I do! I do!
Uh, theropods have hollow bones

00:09:55.067 --> 00:09:56.167
[ Laughter ]
and three toes on each limb."

00:09:56.167 --> 00:09:58.200
Enough!
[ Laughter ]

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.567
All of this, once again,
proves that,

00:09:59.567 --> 00:10:01.734
even when they hold power,
as they do now in the House,

00:10:01.734 --> 00:10:03.968
Republicans are not
a serious governing party.

00:10:03.968 --> 00:10:05.267
They can't be bothered
to do anything

00:10:05.267 --> 00:10:07.067
about real issues
that affect real people,

00:10:07.067 --> 00:10:08.767
but they seem to have
plenty of time

00:10:08.767 --> 00:10:10.868
to fantasize
about bombing Mexico

00:10:10.868 --> 00:10:13.601
or fending off a nonexistent
invasion from Canada.

00:10:13.601 --> 00:10:15.067
They can't stop
embarrassing themselves.

00:10:15.067 --> 00:10:17.434
In fact, in Boebert's case,
she was so humiliated,

00:10:17.434 --> 00:10:18.934
I think she might've been
guilty of...

00:10:18.934 --> 00:10:20.300
-Public urination.

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.801
[ Laughter and applause ]
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:10:22.801 --> 00:10:26.467
♪♪
[ Cheering and applause ]

